ot go quite his way, and he ends up learning a bitter lesson. Detective Lynch corners Lehiff in an open field, and the scene is set for a confrontation that ends in an unexpected way. As the credits roll, Noeleen and Sam are back together in their house watching television. She is sitting purposely on the remote control and bullying him into changing the channels by hand.\nA:"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Ben is shooting a scene about a traffic accident involving a double-decker bus. He is told to focus his attention on Sally, Deirdre's sister, who helped the passengers after the bus crash."}]}
